 "summary": "The new tensor-bundle pullback and covering continuity lemmas, `linearMapAt_pullback`, `bundleTensorEquivOfNeZero` and the `c\u2081` tensor lemmas have no counterpart in Mathlib or Tau Ceti; the nearest analogues (`isoTensorUnitOfSectionNeZero` on smooth cores, `ContinuousLinearMap.inCoordinates_pullback_of_mem` for hom bundles, and `bundleTensorCongr`, which is over a single base) cannot replace them. The PR reuses `firstChernClass_eq_of_fiberwise`, `firstChernClass_eq_singularCohomologyMap_of_fiberwise`, `bundleTensorCommHomeomorph`, `continuous_bundleTensorMap`, `continuous_hom_bundle_iff` and `Continuous.tmul_section`, and generalises `lineCoord` in place rather than restating it.",
